    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Somewhere in the past couple of years, wearing one fragrance stopped cutting it. Open TikTok or Instagram and you will find fragrance lovers layering two, sometimes three bottles together to build completely bespoke scent profiles that cannot be bought off a retail shelf.</p><p>Layering allows you to become your own perfumer. It transforms familiar crowd-pleasers into singular, customized signatures that keep everyone guessing. But layering is also easy to get wrong if you simply spray two heavy perfumes on top of each other and hope for the best.</p>"
      }
    },
